                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of the more interesting games I've played, and I don't know what to say.\n\nThe Cat and the Coup is a short puzzle game where you play as Dr. Mohammed Mossadegh's cat. You follow Mohammed Mossadegh through artistic backgrounds. I'm not sure how accurate it is to Iran's history in the 1960s, but it is an interesting take. The graphics and music are great for a game made back in 2011, and I don't think I had many issues with it.",
